---
title: 夜间银行流水入账
config:
  themeVariables:
    actorBorder: '#7dd3fc'
    signalColor: '#6ee7b7'
---
zenuml
    @Actor Clock as 调度
    Import as 导入
    Ledger as 账本
    @Starter(Clock)

    Import.入账(单) {
        while (还有流水) {
            Ledger.记(流水) {
                if (已入账) {
                    return 重复跳过
                } else {
                    写入()
                    return 入账成功
                }
            }
            汇总()
        }
        return 入账汇总
    }
